+> docker run -v "$(pwd):/code" -w /code sokrates init
+
+### Landscape command
+
+* `analyzeLandscape -analysisRoot <folder>` creates or updates the landscape report (`<folder>/_sokrates_landscape/config.json` and `index.html`), aggregating the repository analyses found under the analysis root. It is the landscape counterpart of the analysis commands.
+* `updateLandscape` is the previous name of the same command and still works, with the same options.
+* Run `java -jar sokrates.jar analyzeLandscape -help` for the options.
\ No newline at end of file
